  "notes": [
    "Not drawn here: education service districts also get a share of the State School Fund, and Student Investment Account grants also go to some charter schools and youth corrections and juvenile detention education programs [SRC:legislature/ors/ors327.html] [SRC:ode/sia/2026-01_sia-legislative-report.pdf p.3]. Some programs are paid from the State School Fund before the formula shares it, and some districts with a local option levy get a Local Option Equalization Grant from the state [SRC:legislature/olis/2025R1/293759_ssf-budget-review.pdf p.1]."
  ]
